Commit: `c060fd0 Add individual image selection`

What changed:
- Added `Choose Images...` with multi-file image selection.
- Folder picks and image picks replace the working set.
- Export now writes each image to its own parent’s `Watermarked/` folder.
- Finder reveals the first successful output folder only.
- Last-session restore now persists/restores actual image file bookmarks.
- Empty sidebar text mentions both folder and individual image selection.

Verification passed:
`xcodebuild -scheme WatermarkFactory -configuration Release build`

